# Biotech Sniper — VCS ignores.
#
# Patterns are intentionally broad (``**/...``) so they match nested
# locations like ``biotech_sniper/state/...`` as well as the top-level
# ``state/``. The original 22k-LOC project committed runtime state JSONs
# under ``biotech_sniper/state/`` — those have been moved to
# ``migrations/seed/`` (so M2 can backfill from them) and the runtime
# state directory is now gitignored to prevent leakage of new state files.

# --- Python ----------------------------------------------------------------
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python

# --- Virtual environments --------------------------------------------------
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/

# --- Distribution / packaging ----------------------------------------------
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
*.egg

# --- Secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key

# --- Live-trading confirmation marker (only the user creates this) --------
i-understand-this-trades-real-money

# --- Runtime state, db, logs (broad patterns: match nested locations) -----
**/state/*.json
**/state/*.jsonl
**/data/*.db
**/data/*.db-wal
**/data/*.db-shm
**/data/training/*.parquet
**/logs/
**/*.log

# --- Generated reports / models / backups ---------------------------------
# Anything inside a ``reports/`` directory is treated as build-output and
# never committed (ignore everything except a placeholder ``.gitkeep``).
**/reports/*
!**/reports/.gitkeep
**/reports/*.xlsx
**/reports/*.pdf
**/reports/*.html
**/models/*.lgb
**/models/*.manifest.json
**/backups/*.gz

# --- Module-import byproducts (legacy, tracked from original project) -----
# Several modules under biotech_sniper/ write JSON/TXT/XLSX byproducts at
# import time (twitter_report.json, batch_a_fresh.txt, the dated
# Biotech_Catalyst_Sniper_*.xlsx). These were committed in the original
# project import and now show up as git-status-modified after every smoke
# run. Treat them as build-output: gitignore + git rm --cached.
**/intelligence/*.json
biotech_sniper/options_chains/*.txt
biotech_sniper/*.xlsx
# Some scripts emit the Biotech_Catalyst_Sniper_*.xlsx at the repo root
# depending on the cwd from which they're invoked. Cover both locations.
/Biotech_Catalyst_Sniper_*.xlsx

# --- OS / editor noise -----------------------------------------------------
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# --- Pytest / coverage -----------------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/
